``` Password spray against Windows authentication
    MITRE ATT&CK: T1110.003 Password Spraying
    Logic: one source failing logon for many distinct accounts within an hour.
    Known false positives: shared NAT or VPN sources, service accounts with stale passwords.
    Tuning: exclude known egress sources with a lookup and adjust the threshold to your baseline. ```
index=wineventlog EventCode=4625 earliest=-1h
| stats dc(TargetUserName) as failed_accounts count as attempts values(TargetUserName) as sample_users min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen by IpAddress
| where failed_accounts >= 15
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)
| sort - failed_accounts
